    \"This comparison does not measure a consensus decision divergence.\",\n    \"No global agreement, recovery completion or application-order consequence is asserted.\",\n    \"Does not execute the final recovery-selection handler or application endpoint.\"\n  ],\n  \"review_ids\": [],\n  \"open_issue_ids\": [],\n  \"correspondence\": null,\n  \"reviewed_complete\": false,\n  \"bounded_complete\": true,\n  \"confirmed\": false,\n  \"outcome\": \"violated\",\n  \"level\": \"implementation_test\",\n  \"claim_id\": \"C_prepare_vballot_preserved\",\n  \"claim_version\": 1,\n  \"framework_revision\": \"audit-products-v55\",\n  \"finding_ids\": {\n    \"K_prepare_vballot\": \"08dfd7ed73ea4befa5e7b3ed7d430245\"\n  },\n  \"finding_id\": \"08dfd7ed73ea4befa5e7b3ed7d430245\"\n}\nclaims {\n  \"id\": \"C_prepare_vballot_preserved\",\n  \"kind\": \"obligation\",\n  \"concern\": \"implementation_semantics\",\n  \"description\": \"For a PrepareReply produced by handlePrepare for a legal instance history and delivered intact through the registered serialization path to a fresh PrepareReply object, the decoded VBallot must equal the value ballot reported by the producer. The separate promise Ballot must not substitute for this consumed value context.\",\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"description\": \"Local preservation of the value-ballot field across an intact PrepareReply transport boundary.\",\n    \"assumptions\": [\n      \"Non-Byzantine peers and intact bytes\",\n      \"Handler-produced report and fresh registered receiver object\",\n      \"No concurrent mutation while the report is serialized\"\n    ],\n    \"excluded\": [\n      \"Global consensus agreement\",\n      \"Recovery termination\",\n      \"Crash-restart persistence\",\n      \"Duplicate-delivery tolerance\",\n      \"Preservation of all other fields as independent obligations\"\n    ],\n    \"parameters\": {}\n  },\n  \"source\": \"Candidate derived from attributed implementation responsibilities\",\n  \"source_ids\": [\n    \"S_prepare\",\n    \"S_prepare_codec\",\n    \"S_recover_select\",\n    \"S_rpc\",\n    \"S_transport_send\",\n    \"S_transport_recv\",\n    \"S_reply_type\"\n  ],\n  \"pending\": [],\n  \"assessment\": \"unassessed\",\n  \"candidate\": true,\n  \"grounding\": {\n    \"source_ids\": [\n      \"S_prepare\",\n      \"S_prepare_codec\",\n      \"S_recover_select\",\n      \"S_rpc\",\n      \"S_transport_send\",\n      \"S_transport_recv\",\n      \"S_reply_type\"\n    ],\n    \"expectation_ids\": [\n      \"S_reply_type\",\n      \"S_prepare\",\n      \"S_recover_select\",\n      \"S_rpc\"\n    ],\n    \"binding_ids\": [\n      \"BD_prepare_producer\",\n      \"BD_prepare_encoder\",\n      \"BD_prepare_decoder\",\n      \"BD_prepare_consumer\"\n    ],\n    \"derivation\": \"The typed PrepareReply interface includes a separate VBallot; handlePrepare populates it from the stored value tag, and handlePrepareReply explicitly compares it to select prior supported metadata. SendMsg and replicaListener constitute serialization of that typed report, with no intermediate VBallot reconstruction. Preserving this consumed field is the local implementation responsibility; this is derived from composed producer/interface/consumer duties, not from assuming consensus correctness or treating the discrepancy itself as normative authority.\",\n    \"applicability\": \"Legal non-Byzantine handler-produced PrepareReply delivered without byte loss to a fresh object from the registered New method, in volatile thrifty operation.\",\n    \"unresolved\": [\n      \"No global agreement, recovery completion or application-order consequence is asserted.\"\n    ],\n    \"conflicts\": [],\n    \"alternatives\": [\n      \"Promise Ballot is distinct from VBallot; preserving only Ballot does not supply the selected value context.\",\n      \"Zero VBallot would mask an omission; the fixed prefix establishes an original ballot of 1.\",\n      \"PreAcceptReply preserves VBallot through its own codec; it is not an alternate decoder for PrepareReply.\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"version\": 1\n}\ndirect_checks {\n  \"id\": \"508c74784d3344ada2c0e266a36b63ed\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"plan_path\": \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-06_20-14-33-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run/direct-checks/5ec99f304c634b909da9f6c724dd3107/plan.json\",\n  \"harness_path\": \"/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-06_20-14-33-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run/direct-checks/5ec99f304c634b909da9f6c724dd3107/epaxos/assurance_generated_test.go\",\n  \"snapshot_id\": \"31cde94c3a9e42cdb9417563a0bc03fd\",\n  \"unit_id\": \"unit-C_prepare_vballot_preserved\",\n  \"claim_id\": \"C_prepare_vballot_preserved\",\n  \"binding_ids\": [\n    \"BD_prepare_producer\",\n    \"BD_prepare_encoder\",\n    \"BD_prepare_decoder\",\n    \"BD_prepare_consumer\"\n  ],\n  \"graph_versions\": {\n    \"C_prepare_vballot_preserved\": 1,\n    \"BD_prepare_producer\": 1,\n    \"BD_prepare_encoder\": 1,\n    \"BD_prepare_decoder\": 1,\n    \"BD_prepare_consumer\": 1,\n    \"unit-C_prepare_vballot_preserved\": 1\n  },\n  \"origin\": \"agent_generated\",\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"description\": \"Local preservation of the value-ballot field across an intact PrepareReply transport boundary.\",\n    \"assumptions\": [\n      \"Non-Byzantine peers and intact bytes\",\n      \"Handler-produced report and fresh registered receiver object\",\n      \"No concurrent mutation while the report is serialized\"\n    ],\n    \"excluded\": [\n      \"Global consensus agreement\",\n      \"Recovery termination\",\n      \"Crash-restart persistence\",\n      \"Duplicate-delivery tolerance\",\n      \"Preservation of all other fields as independent obligations\"\n    ],\n    \"parameters\": {}\n  },\n  \"operation_id\": \"5ec99f304c634b909da9f6c724dd3107\",\n  \"previous_id\": null\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
